- Maintain a clean workspace: follow hygiene and safety protocols to ensure a safe and organized working environment;
- Collaborate with colleagues: communicate effectively within a diverse team to keep production running smoothly;
- Work in shifts: commit to a minimum of 24 hours per week, including evening and night shifts, with flexibility in scheduling;
